@ Alt, alt

~ "Functor" Functor

.. Keep the lower value when it is a result, otherwise the upper one.
.. An array keeps both, lower first.
& Functor f => Alt f
  .. The lower value when it is a result, otherwise the upper one.
  alt ( (f a) (f a) -- (f a) )

. ..................................................................................................

# Alt Array
  alt = alt_array

: foreign alt_array ( ( Array a ) ( Array a ) -- ( Array a ) )
